SCIENTIFIC SAFEGUARDS REMAIN IN FORCE

This execution override changes computational authorization only.

It does NOT authorize changing scientific criteria.

Continue to preserve:
- frozen hardened-alpha artifacts;
- the sealed final holdout;
- scientific acceptance thresholds;
- evidence and dependence definitions;
- missingness semantics;
- source provenance;
- literature lifecycle/retraction/version semantics;
- fail-closed behavior;
- unrelated user changes.

Do NOT:
- rerun or tune against the sealed holdout;
- weaken acceptance criteria;
- manufacture expert labels;
- infer unsupported biological/scientific facts;
- silently change endpoints or denominators;
- discard existing validated work;
- force-push or rewrite validated Git history unnecessarily.

Do not mark the overall project COMPLETE immediately after hardened alpha.

After hardened alpha, mark:

HARDENED_ALPHA_COMPLETE

and transition directly to Phase 2.

